al em HSS PointTeQ \u00e9 fabricada de acordo com a norma DIN 338. A broca \u00e9 do tipo N (\u00e2ngulo da espiral) com uma ponta de 135 graus. Tem um sistema de encabadouro cil\u00edndrico (encabadouro igual ao di\u00e2metro da broca) e destina-se a ser utilizada em suportes da broca e berbequins-aparafusadoras.","unit_price":24.53,"description_short_pt":"","image":"https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/1\/394831.jpg","galeria":"https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/1\/394831.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/2\/394832.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/3\/394833.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/4\/394834.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/5\/394835.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/6\/394836.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/7\/394837.jpg","quantity":0,"images":["https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/1\/394831.jpg","https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/2\/394832.jpg","https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/3\/394833.jpg","https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/4\/394834.jpg","https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/5\/394835.jpg","https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/6\/394836.jpg","https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/3\/9\/4\/8\/3\/7\/394837.jpg"],"sub_category":"Berbequim","wholesale_price":"21.53","unit_price_tax":24.53},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["3165140917704"],"reference":"09.660.002.00002","name":{"1":"BOSCH - Set Brocas Metal ProBox 25un 2608577352","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<b>PERFURA\u00c7\u00c3O R\u00c1PIDA EM METAL<\/b> A broca para metal HSS PointTeQ permite perfura\u00e7\u00e3o r\u00e1pida em metal gra\u00e7as ao desenho da ponta PointTeQ\n- A taxa de perfura\u00e7\u00e3o superior produz menos calor e menos desgaste.\n- O desenho da ponta PointTeQ continua agu\u00e7ado e garante durabilidade continuada\n- Risc